@page "/sms-terms"

<PageTitle>SMS Terms</PageTitle>

<article class="container py-4" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <h1>SMS Terms</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Effective August 25, 2026</p>

    <p>When you opt in, Charlie Company Ventures may send recurring automated text messages about your account, jobs, estimates, scheduling, and other operational updates. We do not use profile SMS consent for third-party marketing.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Message frequency varies.</li>
        <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
        <li>Reply STOP at any time to cancel. We may send one final message confirming the opt-out.</li>
        <li>Reply HELP for help, or contact your Charlie Company Ventures administrator.</li>
        <li>Consent is not a condition of purchase.</li>
        <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
        <li>Do not rely on text messaging for emergencies or time-critical safety issues.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can also withdraw consent from your account profile. Changing your mobile number requires a new consent for that number.</p>
</article>
